```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Start Forward Chaining]) --> InitMemory[Initialize Working Memory with User Facts]
    InitMemory --> LoadKB[Load Validated Knowledge Base Rules]
    LoadKB --> SetIter[Set Iteration = 1, NewFactsInIteration = 0]

    SetIter --> CheckLimit{Iteration > MaxIterations?}
    CheckLimit -- Yes --> HaltLimit[Halt: Execution Safety Limit Exceeded]
    CheckLimit -- No --> LoopRules[Iterate over Rules R in RuleBase]

    LoopRules --> AlreadyFired{Rule R Already Fired?}
    AlreadyFired -- Yes --> NextRule[Next Rule]
    AlreadyFired -- No --> EvalAntecedent[Evaluate Antecedent of R using Kleene K3 Logic]

    EvalAntecedent --> IsTrue{Antecedent == TRUE?}
    IsTrue -- No --> RecordAudit[Record Non-Firing Step in Audit Trace]
    RecordAudit --> NextRule

    IsTrue -- Yes --> ApplyModusPonens[Apply Modus Ponens: Fire Rule R]
    ApplyModusPonens --> CheckExisting{Consequent Fact already in Memory?}
    CheckExisting -- Yes --> MarkFired[Mark Rule R as Fired]
    CheckExisting -- No --> AddFact[Add Consequent to Working Memory as INFERRED]
    AddFact --> IncrementFacts[NewFactsInIteration++]
    IncrementFacts --> MarkFired

    MarkFired --> RecordStep[Record Fired Step in Trace]
    RecordStep --> NextRule

    NextRule --> MoreRules{More Rules in current Iteration?}
    MoreRules -- Yes --> LoopRules
    MoreRules -- No --> CheckNewFacts{NewFactsInIteration == 0?}

    CheckNewFacts -- Yes --> FixedPoint[Fixed-Point Reached: Saturation]
    CheckNewFacts -- No --> NextIteration[Iteration++, Reset NewFactsInIteration = 0]
    NextIteration --> CheckLimit

    FixedPoint --> ExtractHypotheses[Extract Final Supported Condition Hypotheses]
    HaltLimit --> ExtractHypotheses
    ExtractHypotheses --> ReturnResult([Return ForwardChainingResult & Trace])
```
